ac_one_freq: a resistor divider's AC response at one listed frequency, 1/(2*pi) Hz written as its digits, as VACASK's demo/natures decks list it (they write `1/(2*M_PI)`, a typed division of integers, the expression group's); the frequency vector holds that one value (|v(out)| = 0.75)
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=0.0 mag=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
r2 (out 0) resistor r=3k
control
  analysis ac1 ac values=[0.15915494309189535]
endc
